    "text": "Tuscaloosa\nAlabama Announces Kickoff Times for 2025 Football Season\nBy Wyatt Fulton,\n12 hours agoStart planning your trips across the SEC, Alabama fans, as the Crimson Tide has officially announced kickoff times for some of the Crimson Tide's matchups for the 2025 college football season. The 'flex' time window dominates most of the kickoff schedule, with games set to kick off anytime between 2:30...",
